  "authenticator-app-2fa-secure": { shots: ["/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/1.jpg","/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/2.jpg","/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/3.jpg","/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/4.jpg","/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/5.jpg","/images/apps/shots/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/6.jpg"], rating: 5, ratingCount: 1, details: {"description":"Authenticator App 2FA Secure is a simple and reliable 2FA authenticator that helps you protect your online accounts with secure two-factor authentication. With fast OTP / TOTP code generation, the app adds an extra layer of security and keeps your accounts safe from unauthorized access.\n\nKey Features\n\nSecure 2FA Codes\nGenerate unique, time-based OTP / TOTP authentication codes for quick and safe login to your favorite apps and websites using strong two-factor authentication.\n\nMulti-Platform Compatibility\nWorks seamlessly with Google, Facebook, Instagram, Microsoft, Twitter, Dropbox, and many more 2FA-supported services across the web.\n\nOffline Access\nAccess all your 2FA codes anytime, even without an internet connection, ensuring consistent and secure authentication wherever you are.\n\nWith Authenticator App 2FA Secure, you can easily manage your authentication codes, enhance account security, and simplify your login process using trusted two-factor authentication.\n\nUpgrade your protection effortlessly with a fast, private, and secure OTP authenticator designed for everyday use.\n\n***Premium Subscription***\n\nUpgrade to Premium to unlock all features: unlimited 2FA accounts, advanced authentication tools, and priority support.\n\nYou can choose:\n- Weekly subscription (with 3-day free trial) at $7.99/week\n- Yearly subscription at $49.99/year\n\nPayment & Renewal:\n– Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase (after the free trial period, if offered).\n– Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n– Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, at the same price of $4.99/week or $29.99/year.\n– You can manage subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal in your Account Settings after purchase.\n– Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA):\n https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/privacy-policy\n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/authenticator-app-2fa-secure/terms-conditions","developer":"My Thu Nguyen Thi","version":"1.0.1","updated":"2025-12-01","sizeMB":29,"age":"4+","genres":"Utilities","languages":15} },
